# 從頭再嚟
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:將已經做完嘅事情全部做一遍（量詞：次）
eng:do something from scratch / start over
<eg>
yue:呢個試驗做咗咗唔好，要從頭再嚟一次。 (ni1 ge4 si4 heung1 zo2 zo2 m4 hou2, jiu3 cong4 tau4 zai3 ngok4 yat1 ci3.)
eng:This experiment failed, so we have to do it from scratch once.

</explanation>
</eg> [end of text]


